# Quarto working files
/.quarto/
/_freeze/
*_files/
index.knit.md
slides.knit.md

# ...but not the ones under docs/. Those hold every static figure in the
# rendered site, and without them a published page shows 21 broken
# images while rendering perfectly on the machine that built it.
!/docs/*_files/

# R session
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata

# The rendered site lives in docs/ and IS committed - GitHub Pages
# serves from there. Nothing below docs/ should be ignored.

# Scratch
*.tmp
*.carto_tmp

**/*.quarto_ipynb
data/school-funding-statistics_2025-26.zip
